mail.body:
== Critical root cause: {label.name}
reason: {label.reason}
impacts: {label.impacted}
since: {since}

health-manager roots shows what it impacts; health-manager ack {label.name} --note <why> silences it and its symptoms.
In Grafana (Explore, Loki): {query}

== Critical root cause recovered: {label.name}
since: {since}

health-manager list shows what is still not ok.
In Grafana (Explore, Loki): {query}

== New open critical/high CVEs: {label.count}
modules: {label.modules}

{label.items}

health-manager report security --cves shows each module's CVEs and its risk score.
To analyse one: cve-triage.sh open <module>. To quiet a module: health-manager ack <module> --type security --note <why>.
In Grafana (Explore, Loki): {query}

== CVE risk level up: {label.name}
now: {label.message}
since: {since}

health-manager report security --cves shows what counts.
health-manager ack {label.name} --type security --note <why> silences it until the level changes.
In Grafana (Explore, Loki): {query}
